---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How BostonVentures handles your data.">
  <div class="wrap max-w-3xl py-12 prose-bv">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink/50">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    <p>This site does not ask you to create an account and does not collect your name or email through the tools. The trip planner, hotel matcher and tour finder run in your browser; your answers are not sent to us.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We may use privacy-friendly analytics to count visits and see which pages are useful. This data is aggregated and not used to identify you.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate links and cookies</h2>
    <p>When you click an affiliate link, the partner site (for example USA Transfers or Holafly) may set a cookie so they can credit the booking to us. Their own privacy policies apply on their websites.</p>
    <h2>YouTube videos</h2>
    <p>Videos load only when you click play, using YouTube privacy-enhanced mode. YouTube may then set cookies under its own policy.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy: hello@bostonventurestravel.com.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
